# Built documentation. `docs/tester-onboarding-runbook.pdf` is printed from
# `docs/runbook/tester-onboarding-runbook.html` and changes wholesale every time
# a sentence does, so the PDF stays out of git and the source goes in. The
# source used to live only in a published artifact; it was lost, and the
# 2026-09-18 edition had to be rebuilt from the PDF. Rebuild command: §6i.
docs/*.pdf
